					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.width" value="px"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement>
					<font size="10"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[Certification status of teachers as reported by schools in the annual census roster, with the certification record FedEMIS bases the status on (a teacher training record or an earlier census). Schools should verify this list; incorrect data should be marked on a printed copy and re-entered in the FedEMIS workbook or the teacher training records.]]></text>
			</staticText>
